  "content": "# 第32题\n\n**题型**: 选择题\n\n**难度**: ★★★☆☆\n\n**分值**: 2分\n\n---\n\n## 题目内容\n\n32. What leads to Taylor’s optimism about quantum computing?\n\n## 选项\n\nA. A. His dominance in physics.\n\nB. B. The competition in the field.\n\nC. C. His confidence in PyQuantum.\n\nD. D. The investment of tech companies.\n\n---\n\n## 参考答案\n\nC\n\n",
  "answer": "D",
  "analysis": "本题考查动词辨析。A项‘建议’；B项‘坚持’；C项‘要求’；D项‘推荐’。句意：你能推荐一本好书给我吗？故选D。"
